# animate exec: OpShiftRightArithmetic fills with the sign bit of the
# bits, whatever the type's signedness (a uint operand too)
animate exec %px = lane lanes 4 seed 1 nofile
```spv
%l = OpLoad %uint %px
%b = OpShiftLeftLogical %uint %l %uint_30
%s = OpShiftRightArithmetic %uint %b %uint_31
%t = OpShiftRightArithmetic %int %b %uint_31
```
